{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.KZ.SmallHbar","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.KZ.SmallHbar","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_Φ_sub_one_lt_half","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_Φ_sub_one_lt_half","kind":"theorem","line":302,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/SmallHbar.lean#L302-L329","doc":"**Explicit radius.** If `‖A‖, ‖B‖ ≤ 1/12`, then `‖Φ(A, B) − 1‖ < 1/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_Φ_sub_one_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_Φ_sub_one_le","kind":"theorem","line":244,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/SmallHbar.lean#L244-L300","doc":"**Quantitative bound on the KZ associator for small residues.** If `‖A‖, ‖B‖ ≤ a < 1/4`,\nthen `‖Φ(A, B) − 1‖ ≤ e^{2 a log 2}·(1 + a/(1 − 3a))(1 + a/(1 − 4a)) − 1`\n(written as `(1 + δₑ)² (1 + δ)(1 + δ') − 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_tpow_half_sub_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_tpow_half_sub_one","kind":"theorem","line":237,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/SmallHbar.lean#L237-L242","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_mul_sub_one_le'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_mul_sub_one_le'","kind":"theorem","line":230,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/SmallHbar.lean#L230-L234","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_series_half_sub_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_series_half_sub_one","kind":"theorem","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/SmallHbar.lean#L176-L219","doc":"**The gauge series at `t = 1/2`.** `‖H(1/2) − 1‖ ≤ β/(1 − β)`, `β = a/(1 − 2a)`, for\n`a < 1/3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_coeff_succ_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_coeff_succ_le","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/SmallHbar.lean#L170-L174","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_coeff_le_small","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_coeff_le_small","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/SmallHbar.lean#L129-L167","doc":"**Coefficient estimate for small residues.** With `β = a/(1 − 2a)` and `λ = 1 + β`:\n`∑_{j ≤ k} ‖H_j‖ ≤ λ^k` and `‖H_{k+1}‖ ≤ β λ^k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.coeff_step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.coeff_step","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/SmallHbar.lean#L96-L126","doc":"One step of the coefficient estimate: for `k ≥ 1`,\n`k (1 − 2a) ‖H_k‖ ≤ a ∑_{j<k} ‖H_j‖`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_mul_sub_one_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_mul_sub_one_le","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/SmallHbar.lean#L84-L93","doc":"`‖xy − 1‖ ≤ ‖x − 1‖ + ‖y − 1‖ + ‖x − 1‖‖y − 1‖`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_inverse_sub_one_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_inverse_sub_one_le","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/SmallHbar.lean#L55-L81","doc":"**Inverse near `1`.** If `‖u − 1‖ < 1` then `u` is a unit and\n`‖u⁻¹ − 1‖ ≤ ‖u − 1‖ / (1 − ‖u − 1‖)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_exp_sub_one_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.SmallHbar.norm_exp_sub_one_le","kind":"theorem","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/SmallHbar.lean#L29-L52","doc":"`‖e^x − 1‖ ≤ e^{‖x‖} − 1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}